Usage:
  codebase-memory-mcp cli delete_project --flag value [--flag2 value2 ...]
  codebase-memory-mcp cli delete_project --args-file <path-to-json>
  echo '<json>' | codebase-memory-mcp cli delete_project
  codebase-memory-mcp cli delete_project '<raw-json-args>'

Flags:
  --project <string> [required]
